  "bodyText": "Skip to content\n\nSale on now — use \"OriginSale\" at checkout.\n\nCart\nImage 20 is now available in gallery view\nSkip to product information\nOpen media 1 in modal\nOpen media 2 in modal\nOpen media 3 in modal\nOpen media 4 in modal\nOpen media 5 in modal\nOpen media 6 in modal\nOpen media 7 in modal\nOpen media 8 in modal\nOpen media 9 in modal\nOpen media 10 in modal\nOpen media 11 in modal\nOpen media 12 in modal\nOpen media 13 in modal\nOpen media 14 in modal\nOpen media 15 in modal\nOpen media 16 in modal\nOpen media 17 in modal\nOpen media 18 in modal\n\nOrigin\n\n2Unfold Bag\nRegular price\n$995.00 CAD\n\nThis is a demonstration store. You can purchase products like this from Hardgraft.\n\nYour search is over. That is, if you've been looking for a slim, extremely versatile, timeless laptop bag which is carefully handmade with the finest materials. This bag is our tried and tested instant classic with all the bells and whistles.\n\nWe've crafted this multi-use leather laptop bag to be as versatile as possible, which is a good thing because you'll never want to be without it. Carry up to a 17” laptop and accessories as a vertical briefcase, shoulder bag, or backpack. Fold it in half into a messenger bag or folio and carry a 14” laptop and a few more items.\n\nWe meticulously designed every detail of its construction, ensuring every one of its 8 different combinations is functional and joyful. The veg-tan leather and wool shoulder strap is removable, and the bag is lined with a super soft melange grey wool.\n\nMeasurements: 36 x 50 x 6 cm (14\" x 20” x 2.5”)\n\nColor: Gray\nBrown\nGray\nChestnut\nQuantity\nDecrease quantity for 2Unfold Bag\nIncrease quantity for 2Unfold Bag\nAdd to cart\nBuy it now\n\nTHE UPDATES\n\nStay in the know\nEmail\nShop Journal Contact Shipping\nFacebook\nInstagram\nYouTube\nTikTok\nX (Twitter)\nSnapchat\nPayment methods\n© 2026, theme-origin-demo Powered by Shopify"
